---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---
<Base title="Privacy Notice" description="How KaizenAI handles information you share through this website.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="label">Legal</span><h1>Privacy notice</h1><p class="muted">Last updated: November 2026</p></div></section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container"><div class="prose">
      <p>This website is a static site. It does not use advertising trackers or set cookies of its own.</p>
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>If you contact us using the form, email, phone or WhatsApp, we receive the details you choose to share, such as your name, email, company and message. We use them only to reply to you and to discuss a possible engagement.</p>
      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages; fonts are served from this site itself. Contact form submissions are delivered to us by Formspree, a form-handling provider acting on our behalf, and stored in our HubSpot CRM so we can keep track of our conversation with you. The site does not load HubSpot’s tracking script. Each of these providers may log basic technical data such as your IP address.</p>
      <h2>Visit statistics</h2>
      <p>We may use Cloudflare Web Analytics to count visits. It is cookieless and does not build a profile of you. We only see totals, such as page views, referring sites, countries and device types.</p>
      <h2>Meeting booking and translation</h2>
      <p>If you book a meeting, the booking is handled by Calendly, which processes your name, email and chosen time on our behalf under its own privacy policy. If you choose a machine translation from the language menu, the page opens through Google Translate, and Google’s privacy policy applies there.</p>
      <h2>Your theme setting</h2>
      <p>If you switch between light and dark mode, that choice is stored in your browser only. It is never sent to us.</p>
      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to show, correct or delete what we hold about you at any time by emailing <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
    </div></div>
  </section>
</Base>
